### Page 1 of 1

```text
June 6, 2021
Cheyenne City Council
2102 O’Neil Avenue, Room 101
Cheyenne, Wy 82001
Dear Council Members:
Pursuant to W.S. 6-7-101(a)(iii)(F)(Vl), please accept this letter as a notice the USSSA/Randy Weiss 36
Hour softball committee will hold a Calcutta in conjunction with the 2021 Randy Weiss 36 Hour softball
tournament. This will be held on June 17, 2021, at 6:00 pm at AIf’s Pub located at 1622 E 19th Street.
The committee is aware of the statutory requirements relative to Calcutta wagering and the committee
will comply with the law. Rules for the Calcutta will be distributed prior to the Calcutta. Proceeds from
the Calcutta will be paid as follows: 85% to bettors; 10% to bona fide charities; 5% to cover the
committee’s cost to produce the Calcutta.
This notice is sent in accordance with Wyoming Statues noted above and, although no formal action is
required by you, we would be happy to discuss the Calcutta with you if desired.
We appreciate your support.
Best regards,
Scott Redman
USSSA State Slow Pitch Director
```
